Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 11:26:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Economy 0040: no wonders, no city-state gold for any strike
 civ before its strike (LateStrike PREP too)

bullyabort19 game 1 (1468D9F4) stopped: LateStrike Japan sat in strike state PREP
T1-T149 (economy first), which no gate covered (0035/0036/0039 gate the EarlyStrike
book and LateStrike BUILDUP only). It built the Great Library (T50) and Hanging
Gardens (T90) and gave 1,250 gold to city-states (T44, T99) before its first
declaration (T102). New CvPlayer::IsStrikePending (state PREP or BUILDUP, early or
late) joins every wonder and gift gate. NONE when the strike flags are off.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZj2nf4FeZTEHWjvnhhA
